WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a strong plank, shift the weight forward until the shoulders pass the wrists.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Hug the elbows in against the ribs — do not let them splay outward.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Lower halfway on an exhale, upper arms parallel to the floor.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the whole body in one line, gaze slightly forward, then flow on.
